<title>SPAIN: Spain harmonised April CPI 1.6 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Spain harmonised April CPI 1.6 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) gave the following figures:</p>
<p>						APRIL 97    MARCH 97   FEB 97</p>
<p>    Harmonised CPI year-on-year	 1.6	  2.2	 2.5</p>
<p>    CPI, domestic calculation	   1.7	  2.2	 2.5</p>
<p>Maximum level that still</p>
<p>    meets Maastricht's criteria	 2.4	  2.5	 2.6</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
